    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for cold-store value backends. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The backend is responsible <bold>only</bold> for mapping composite keys to JSON-serialised <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_versioned_document" kindref="compound">VersionedDocument</ref> strings. All key ordering, range logic, and RAM indexing live in <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_temporal_cold_store" kindref="compound">TemporalColdStore</ref>; the backend sees only individual put/get/del calls and prefix-based list operations.</para>
<para>Implementations must be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
